  "sourceTitle": "Guava Pineapple Drink",
  "sourceText": "Guava Pineapple Drink\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, January 3, 2010 - 11:55pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups Guava puree\n1 cup Pineapple Juice\n1 1/2 cups Water\n1 cup Brown Sugar or to taste\n1/4 teaspoon grate nutmeg\nPinch of salt for balance\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients in a blender 2 Mix on high speed briefly 3 Chill and serve on crushed ice\n\nAbout\n\n\nThis drink is a favorite throughout the Caribbean.\nFor best results use firm yellow guavas to make the puree.",
